  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop cauliflower into small <br>florets. Slice red onion into thick wedges.<br>• SPICY! This spice blend is hot! Add less if you’re sensitive to heat. Place <br>cauliflower and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle <br>over Mexican Fiesta spice blend and toss to coat. <br>• Roast until tender and brown around the edges, 20-25 minutes. <br>• In the last 5 minutes of cook time, remove tray from oven, then drizzle over <br>the honey, tossing cauliflower to coat. Return to oven and roast <br>until golden. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e37071f8f6928425d5c4a4/step-29a76900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice tomato into wedges. <br>• Thinly slice Qukes lengthwise. <br>• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).<br>• In a small bowl, combine mild chipotle sauce and the mayonnaise.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e37071f8f6928425d5c4a4/step-e758c310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, combine tomato, Qukes, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle <br>of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e37071f8f6928425d5c4a4/step-36481320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide Quke salad between bowls. Top with Mexican charred cauliflower. <br>• Drizzle over creamy chipotle dressing. Garnish with chilli to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e37071f8f6928425d5c4a4/step-dc6b1630.jpg"
    }
  ]
